1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,580
Dance! Dance! Drink! Enjoy!

2
00:00:03,980 --> 00:00:05,660
Don't be shy now!

3
00:00:46,260 --> 00:00:48,020
No flesh to weigh me down.

4
00:00:48,480 --> 00:00:51,280
I mean, not that I had any to begin with.

5
00:00:51,980 --> 00:00:52,940
Skeleton choke.

6
00:00:55,020 --> 00:00:57,549
I'd call myself vain,
but I ain't got them.

7
00:00:57,880 --> 00:00:59,360
Whatever, time to search.

8
00:01:19,920 --> 00:01:26,760
this door smells fishy or rather it
would if I had enough yes three in a row

9
00:01:30,200 --> 00:01:31,900
Oh, that's peculiar.

10
00:01:32,220 --> 00:01:33,455
What are these dolls?

11
00:01:34,260 --> 00:01:35,090
Huh?

12
00:01:36,180 --> 00:01:37,360
No way!

13
00:01:37,940 --> 00:01:39,200
A polygraph?

14
00:01:41,520 --> 00:01:45,520
One dream, one wish.

15
00:01:45,740 --> 00:01:49,000
If you want it, gotta go over the top.

16
00:02:06,380 --> 00:02:09,600
Set and sail and heading for the unknown.

17
00:02:11,160 --> 00:02:14,200
Cutting through the
winds and waves as I go.

18
00:02:15,040 --> 00:02:17,277
Gotta keep it up, never stopping, no.

19
00:02:17,360 --> 00:02:19,677
Cause I'm aiming to get there first, yeah.

20
00:02:19,760 --> 00:02:22,237
It's all or nothing, no time to worry.

21
00:02:22,320 --> 00:02:25,040
Do it later, right now I'm living free.

22
00:02:28,280 --> 00:02:32,277
When your foes look like
they will overwhelm you.

23
00:02:32,360 --> 00:02:37,160
It means your heart's saying
this is what you can't do.

24
00:02:38,120 --> 00:02:40,397
Despite all that to run is not an option.

25
00:02:40,480 --> 00:02:42,497
Once they're close to
feel the satisfaction.

26
00:02:42,580 --> 00:02:44,777
You think I'm rude,
here's my appreciation.

27
00:02:44,860 --> 00:02:47,880
When things are getting
tough, just gotta smile.

28
00:02:50,720 --> 00:02:53,157
If you are going on your way.

29
00:02:53,240 --> 00:02:55,417
And you're looking for
a fresh, brand new day.

30
00:02:55,500 --> 00:02:58,557
Then make sure your only
thought you have is.

31
00:02:58,640 --> 00:03:00,080
Yes, I can.

32
00:03:00,760 --> 00:03:02,897
As you're on your way.

33
00:03:02,980 --> 00:03:05,157
Marked maps will be made.

34
00:03:05,240 --> 00:03:08,080
Yes, with every step that you will take.

35
00:03:08,800 --> 00:03:11,237
Just look at all you've been through.

36
00:03:11,320 --> 00:03:12,957
Look ahead on new horizons.

37
00:03:13,040 --> 00:03:14,817
In view, shining brightly.

38
00:03:14,900 --> 00:03:17,660
Oh, who knows what's waiting for you.

39
00:03:18,880 --> 00:03:20,957
Dream living, that's the way.

40
00:03:21,040 --> 00:03:23,037
Make like a hurricane.

41
00:03:23,120 --> 00:03:25,940
Now, got to make your mark today.

42
00:03:28,560 --> 00:03:31,997
One dream, one wish.

43
00:03:32,080 --> 00:03:33,837
Your dreams don't run away.

44
00:03:33,920 --> 00:03:36,837
Go for the knockout.

45
00:03:36,920 --> 00:03:38,940
Over the top.

46
00:03:45,900 --> 00:03:46,780
Fire!

47
00:03:53,840 --> 00:03:55,520
We've lost connection!

48
00:03:55,980 --> 00:03:58,760
Switch to another camera then! Hurry!

49
00:04:00,920 --> 00:04:01,780
Damn it.

50
00:04:09,840 --> 00:04:10,880
No way!

51
00:04:11,100 --> 00:04:15,512
They made it past our fight on the
fence, but I'm heading up the falls now!

52
00:04:22,200 --> 00:04:23,030
Go!

53
00:04:24,420 --> 00:04:26,891
How are these fish climbing the waterfall?

54
00:04:27,400 --> 00:04:28,920
That's lickety-slick.

55
00:04:29,700 --> 00:04:30,530
Impressive.

56
00:04:31,140 --> 00:04:31,970
Morons!

57
00:04:32,053 --> 00:04:33,537
What the hell are you even doing?

58
00:04:33,620 --> 00:04:36,520
Don't let that hag set
foot on the island. Go!

59
00:04:36,880 --> 00:04:40,137
We have no protection set up once
they clear the water, though, sir.

60
00:04:40,220 --> 00:04:43,337
And to be fair, we're dealing
with some very strong enemies.

61
00:04:43,420 --> 00:04:47,949
We need a lot more time to set up weapons
to take down guys of their caliber.

62
00:04:49,040 --> 00:04:50,080
Stop panicking.

63
00:04:52,280 --> 00:04:53,110
Commander!

64
00:04:56,260 --> 00:04:58,000
Lin-Lin can go to hell.

65
00:04:58,320 --> 00:05:01,580
And she can take her family
with her at that, dammit.

66
00:05:08,020 --> 00:05:10,680
You all need to get your shit together.

67
00:05:16,940 --> 00:05:20,100
Now, prepare for an Alto war!

68
00:05:27,740 --> 00:05:29,920
Let's not be complacent, shall we?

69
00:05:55,700 --> 00:05:58,820
One ship, their
incompetence is astounding.

70
00:06:02,720 --> 00:06:04,280
I'll end this.

71
00:06:11,180 --> 00:06:12,960
We're nearing the top!

72
00:06:13,800 --> 00:06:16,020
It looks like we'll make it up!

73
00:06:16,900 --> 00:06:18,300
Oh, kind of!

74
00:06:18,720 --> 00:06:19,620
I'm here!

75
00:06:21,800 --> 00:06:23,212
Something's approaching!

76
00:06:24,740 --> 00:06:27,180
I see that! Is it King?

77
00:06:28,460 --> 00:06:29,290
Deronatan!

78
00:06:29,373 --> 00:06:30,700
Open fire off!

79
00:06:43,420 --> 00:06:45,480
Lickety-splitting already?

80
00:06:57,960 --> 00:07:00,240
Ma-ma-ma-ma!

81
00:07:00,580 --> 00:07:02,080
Ha-ha-ha-ha!

82
00:07:03,420 --> 00:07:05,361
We're almost to the land of Wano!

83
00:07:08,420 --> 00:07:10,940
Your time is up, Straw Hat.

84
00:07:13,420 --> 00:07:15,008
She's coming back for more!

85
00:07:21,420 --> 00:07:22,596
This might get ugly!

86
00:07:28,420 --> 00:07:29,250
Oh, no!

87
00:07:37,400 --> 00:07:39,380
You little bastard!

88
00:07:42,600 --> 00:07:45,480
I won't let you enter our country.

89
00:07:59,380 --> 00:08:01,500
Enjoy your watery grave, hag.

90
00:08:23,880 --> 00:08:25,360
Hey, you're keeping up!

91
00:08:25,960 --> 00:08:29,620
I'm trying, but why are we
running away in the first place?

92
00:08:29,880 --> 00:08:32,220
They're after Sangoro, not us two!

93
00:08:32,840 --> 00:08:37,057
Did you already forget that you knocked
out one of those Kyoshiro clowns too?

94
00:08:37,140 --> 00:08:39,258
They're going to be looking for you!

95
00:08:42,980 --> 00:08:44,880
Oh, my bad. Pass.

96
00:08:45,900 --> 00:08:48,777
Look, we can't afford to
make Orochi angry right now.

97
00:08:48,860 --> 00:08:51,617
The Tobiropo are the big
dogs and the beast pirates.

98
00:08:51,700 --> 00:08:54,465
So we messed up bad if
they sent them after us.

99
00:08:55,860 --> 00:08:57,660
An enemy! Time to bail!

100
00:09:05,800 --> 00:09:06,920
It's just you two.

101
00:09:07,060 --> 00:09:08,177
Don't scare me like that.

102
00:09:08,260 --> 00:09:10,960
It's not safe here. Follow me. Right.

103
00:09:11,840 --> 00:09:13,546
We're in some deep crap here.

104
00:09:13,780 --> 00:09:15,677
There's no use in pointing fingers.

105
00:09:15,760 --> 00:09:17,517
We can still salvage the mission,

106
00:09:17,600 --> 00:09:21,718
but the element of surprise is the
only thing that's keeping us alive.

107
00:09:21,820 --> 00:09:25,526
If they find out who we are, your
whole crew's as good as dead.

108
00:09:25,720 --> 00:09:26,550
Damn.

109
00:09:26,633 --> 00:09:28,433
That means Nami and Robin are in danger.

110
00:09:29,020 --> 00:09:30,680
Make this one promise to me.

111
00:09:32,460 --> 00:09:36,754
If you're captured, don't say a word
about the Kozuki Clan's involvement.

112
00:09:36,860 --> 00:09:39,036
20 years of vengeance is on the line.

113
00:09:39,620 --> 00:09:43,500
You have to swear to me, even
if they detain and torture you.

114
00:09:45,360 --> 00:09:48,900
You can't mention the samurai
or the minks. You got that?

115
00:09:51,300 --> 00:09:54,640
Keep your mouth shut
and let them kill you.

116
00:09:56,140 --> 00:09:59,540
Loopy would never say something
like that. I'm not him.

117
00:10:00,500 --> 00:10:03,382
So if we hide our faces,
can we still throw down?

118
00:10:03,680 --> 00:10:05,260
Here, check this out.

119
00:10:09,740 --> 00:10:12,200
I'm just an anonymous ass-kicker now!

120
00:10:15,860 --> 00:10:17,860
We should avoid all confrontation.

121
00:10:17,980 --> 00:10:20,397
I don't remember voting
you in as our captain.

122
00:10:20,480 --> 00:10:22,117
You better hope I'm not caught.

123
00:10:22,200 --> 00:10:24,729
Cause I'll spill
everything to save myself!

124
00:10:24,860 --> 00:10:26,397
Not on my watch, you won't!

125
00:10:26,480 --> 00:10:28,237
I'm gonna protect you so hard!

126
00:10:28,320 --> 00:10:29,240
It worked!

127
00:10:29,880 --> 00:10:30,710
Seriously?

128
00:10:40,500 --> 00:10:41,580
A lady!

129
00:10:53,220 --> 00:10:54,780
What caused that?

130
00:10:55,020 --> 00:10:56,255
It must be the enemy!

131
00:11:14,260 --> 00:11:16,180
We have nothing to do with this!

132
00:11:20,740 --> 00:11:22,328
That's our family business!

133
00:11:22,540 --> 00:11:25,277
We're unaffiliated with the
man you're in search of!

134
00:11:25,360 --> 00:11:27,360
You just destroyed our livelihood!

135
00:11:27,560 --> 00:11:30,384
With that, it will be
kicked out of the capital!

136
00:11:34,060 --> 00:11:36,037
You want to hold it against someone?

137
00:11:36,120 --> 00:11:37,740
Then blame it on Sangoro.

138
00:11:40,620 --> 00:11:43,120
Where are the other Sabo shops?

139
00:11:43,400 --> 00:11:47,760
I'll destroy every last
one until I find them!

140
00:11:48,700 --> 00:11:52,720
Bring me the fool who dared to
mess with the Kyoshiro clan!

141
00:11:53,780 --> 00:11:55,760
I'm brewing your patience.

142
00:11:56,300 --> 00:11:59,000
I might just have to eat you!

143
00:12:02,920 --> 00:12:03,750
Sangoro!

144
00:12:05,740 --> 00:12:07,140
Sangoro!

145
00:12:10,600 --> 00:12:12,680
Sangoro! Hey!

146
00:12:14,180 --> 00:12:16,760
Please, come out!

147
00:12:20,480 --> 00:12:21,880
Sangoro!

148
00:12:22,080 --> 00:12:22,920
Show yourself!

149
00:12:23,280 --> 00:12:24,120
What a shame.

150
00:12:27,020 --> 00:12:30,680
It seems like he's too
much of a coward to man up.

151
00:12:35,200 --> 00:12:38,440
I'm in the mood for dessert now.

152
00:12:39,160 --> 00:12:41,537
They want to lure you out. Ignore them.

153
00:12:41,620 --> 00:12:44,600
Our only priority is getting out safe.

154
00:12:46,700 --> 00:12:47,530
No.

155
00:12:49,120 --> 00:12:50,980
I have to help them.

156
00:12:54,180 --> 00:12:56,320
Wait, Sanchi, come back!

157
00:12:57,780 --> 00:12:58,610
Stop!

158
00:12:58,840 --> 00:13:00,837
We have nothing to do with Batman!

159
00:13:00,920 --> 00:13:03,040
Then find him for me!

160
00:13:06,060 --> 00:13:09,280
Bring me Sandoron, the Sabo cook!

161
00:13:16,540 --> 00:13:18,740
Looking for me? Huh?

162
00:13:19,240 --> 00:13:20,520
I'm right here!

163
00:13:22,160 --> 00:13:23,440
Diablo, Jamba!

164
00:13:24,920 --> 00:13:25,750
Konkisei!

165
00:13:41,620 --> 00:13:42,560
He came out!

166
00:13:43,080 --> 00:13:46,740
That's the guy, Scar
with the special Sabo!

167
00:13:53,520 --> 00:13:55,557
So there you are!

168
00:13:55,640 --> 00:14:00,497
I've been looking for you,
what took you so long?

169
00:14:00,580 --> 00:14:02,977
Page one, reporting in.

170
00:14:03,060 --> 00:14:07,057
Found the target, sixth
block, district two, right?

171
00:14:07,140 --> 00:14:09,375
Roger, that we'll send in some backup!

172
00:14:11,460 --> 00:14:12,680
Hehehehe. Excellent.

173
00:14:13,180 --> 00:14:14,917
You prepared to meet your end?

174
00:14:15,000 --> 00:14:17,120
You got dinosaur powers, huh?

175
00:14:23,120 --> 00:14:24,400
You asshole!

176
00:14:29,320 --> 00:14:31,960
Sangoro! Come on! Time to go!

177
00:14:32,360 --> 00:14:35,536
If Drake and Hawkins show
up, then everything is over.

178
00:14:35,760 --> 00:14:36,620
I know.

179
00:14:43,180 --> 00:14:47,057
but luckily this bastard
doesn't know who I am.

180
00:14:47,140 --> 00:14:50,697
I won't get injured and
I'll stay undercover.

181
00:14:50,780 --> 00:14:53,368
i just have to beat him
in an instant right.

182
00:15:01,960 --> 00:15:04,380
recruiting allies is important of course.

183
00:15:05,980 --> 00:15:08,697
but having fewer enemies is good too.

184
00:15:08,780 --> 00:15:12,660
You're gonna back up those
big words you're using.

185
00:15:21,320 --> 00:15:23,300
guys go on without me!

186
00:15:33,120 --> 00:15:35,200
I promise they won't find out.

187
00:15:40,700 --> 00:15:43,120
My identity will remain a secret.

188
00:15:43,520 --> 00:15:45,797
That cook guy really came out of hiding?

189
00:15:45,880 --> 00:15:46,800
What the hell?

190
00:15:47,060 --> 00:15:48,589
Does he have a death wish?

191
00:15:51,220 --> 00:15:52,537
Well, what do you know?

192
00:15:52,620 --> 00:15:55,080
I found a use for this thing. Huh?

193
00:15:56,160 --> 00:15:57,460
What is that?

194
00:15:57,740 --> 00:15:59,060
A can of food?

195
00:16:01,840 --> 00:16:04,546
Now, don't go getting
the wrong idea about me.

196
00:16:04,940 --> 00:16:08,234
Just because I'm trying this
doesn't mean I'm like them.

197
00:16:08,900 --> 00:16:11,253
I'm willing to give this a shot, though.

198
00:16:11,680 --> 00:16:14,327
Why do you insist on
making things difficult?

199
00:16:14,780 --> 00:16:17,377
So what do you think
Sangoro has planned, huh?

200
00:16:17,460 --> 00:16:19,636
We're fighting an emperor of the sea.

201
00:16:20,380 --> 00:16:23,237
There are going to be times
when we can't save a life,

202
00:16:23,320 --> 00:16:25,261
especially if we're too stubborn.

203
00:16:25,360 --> 00:16:30,007
But if I swallow my pride, then there
are people I can save right here and now.

204
00:16:30,840 --> 00:16:33,520
I'm tired of hearing you kill you!

205
00:16:37,500 --> 00:16:41,088
If this has the power to help,
then I clearly need to use it.

206
00:16:42,240 --> 00:16:43,700
Well, here goes.

207
00:17:11,240 --> 00:17:13,980
You really like wasting
my time, don't you?

208
00:17:14,200 --> 00:17:16,788
What's changing your
clothes supposed to do?

209
00:17:16,900 --> 00:17:17,737
Black leg.

210
00:17:17,820 --> 00:17:18,660
Ugh!

211
00:17:18,880 --> 00:17:19,760
That costume!

212
00:17:19,980 --> 00:17:21,820
Like a superhero! Wow!

213
00:17:22,280 --> 00:17:23,200
So cool!

214
00:17:23,440 --> 00:17:24,740
How's that thing work?

215
00:17:25,420 --> 00:17:27,340
Hold up. Seriously?

216
00:17:27,860 --> 00:17:29,720
I recognize that outfit.

217
00:17:34,100 --> 00:17:36,040
That can't be right, can it?

218
00:17:36,540 --> 00:17:38,900
That's from Saru, Warrior of the Sea.

219
00:17:39,180 --> 00:17:41,637
He's wearing one of
the villain's costumes.

220
00:17:41,720 --> 00:17:44,160
Actually, it's all coming back to me now.

221
00:17:45,660 --> 00:17:50,620
That's the third member of the army of
evil, Germa Double Six Stealth Black.

222
00:17:53,540 --> 00:17:55,917
How the hell do you
know so much about this?

223
00:17:56,000 --> 00:17:58,777
Everyone knows their
comics, huge in the north.

224
00:17:58,860 --> 00:18:01,137
Blue, whatever I don't care.

225
00:18:01,220 --> 00:18:04,177
Look, don't ever call me that again.

226
00:18:04,260 --> 00:18:05,777
You got that?

227
00:18:05,860 --> 00:18:07,837
I know my stuff.

228
00:18:07,920 --> 00:18:08,817
I was a.

229
00:18:08,900 --> 00:18:10,397
I'm a regular reader of the series.

230
00:18:10,480 --> 00:18:13,760
I rooted for Saru to kick
Jerma's ass time after time.

231
00:18:13,920 --> 00:18:15,273
Well, I hated him, too!

232
00:18:15,480 --> 00:18:17,040
Don't ignore me! Huh?

233
00:18:17,460 --> 00:18:20,880
Whatever you got going
on, it's fishy as hell.

234
00:18:21,520 --> 00:18:22,350
Name yourself.

235
00:18:26,940 --> 00:18:28,220
I am...

236
00:18:33,360 --> 00:18:34,600
Sabo Mask!

237
00:18:36,940 --> 00:18:40,737
That name sucks, and
he's obviously Jerma—oh,

238
00:18:40,820 --> 00:18:45,677
come on, man, was that the best you got?

239
00:18:45,760 --> 00:18:48,357
Why didn't you ask us for help, bro?

240
00:18:48,440 --> 00:18:50,177
Are you joking?

241
00:18:50,260 --> 00:18:53,697
What kind of name is Sober Mask?

242
00:18:53,780 --> 00:18:54,610
But

243
00:19:00,900 --> 00:19:03,137
he was just here—where did he go?

244
00:19:03,220 --> 00:19:04,050
he go

245
00:19:04,560 --> 00:19:05,390
What?

246
00:19:05,580 --> 00:19:07,780
How is he floating like that?

247
00:19:09,580 --> 00:19:11,200
Check it out. Whoa.

248
00:19:11,580 --> 00:19:12,992
I knew it when I saw it.

249
00:19:13,180 --> 00:19:14,480
No doubt about it.

250
00:19:14,660 --> 00:19:15,660
That's Germatech.

251
00:19:15,880 --> 00:19:17,400
His shoes, especially.

252
00:19:17,780 --> 00:19:19,368
It's how they hover around.

253
00:19:20,020 --> 00:19:21,373
That's their trademark.

254
00:19:23,840 --> 00:19:25,660
Show us what you can do!

255
00:19:27,560 --> 00:19:30,820
I said you could beat
me by playing dress-up!

256
00:19:33,680 --> 00:19:34,510
Let's go.

257
00:19:57,260 --> 00:19:59,800
Give me the here.

258
00:20:02,440 --> 00:20:04,400
You really whooped her.

259
00:20:13,100 --> 00:20:17,600
You sure like pissing me
off, don't you, little pest?

260
00:20:30,280 --> 00:20:31,720
How's this happening?

261
00:20:32,780 --> 00:20:33,980
What the heck?

262
00:20:34,220 --> 00:20:36,573
I think he's blocking his claws somehow.

263
00:20:36,700 --> 00:20:39,288
That's the power of
Germa Double Six's cape.

264
00:20:39,700 --> 00:20:41,960
They can form a rock-solid barrier.

265
00:20:46,560 --> 00:20:50,740
That may have worked once,
but I won't fall for it again.

266
00:20:53,540 --> 00:20:54,840
